msgctxt "CompareContinuousDistributions|"
msgid "Goodness of fit"
msgstr "拟合优度"

msgctxt "CompareContinuousDistributions|"
msgid ""
"Compute goodness of fit tests. For most of the distributions, the default "
"tests are Cramér-von Mises and Anderson-Darling for composite null "
"hypothesis. Note that these tests rely on randomly splitting the data in two "
"sets;\t\t\t\tas a result, the results may be variable, especially for small "
"sample sizes.\t\t\t\tWhen a distribution does not have free parameters "
"(i.e., all parameters are fixed), the tests are Kolmorogov-Smirnov, and "
"Cramér-von Mises and Anderson-Darling for simple null hypothesis. "
"\t\t\t\tFor normal distributions with free location and scale parameters, "
"specific versions of goodness of fit tests are computed, appropriate for "
"this setting. If the normal distribution has some parameters fixed, it is "
"treated as any other distribution."
msgstr ""
"计算拟合优度检验。对于大多数分布，默认检验为复合零假设下的 Cramér-von Mises "
"和 Anderson-Darling。请注意，这些检验依赖将数据随机分成两组；因此结果可能不稳"
"定，尤其在小样本时。当分布没有自由参数（即所有参数固定）时，检验为简单零假设"
"下的 Kolmogorov-Smirnov、Cramér-von Mises 和 Anderson-Darling。对于位置和尺度"
"参数自由的正态分布，将计算适用于该情形的特定拟合优度检验。如果正态分布有部分"
"参数固定，则按其他分布处理。"

msgctxt "CompareContinuousDistributions|"
msgid "Parametric bootstrap from"
msgstr "参数 Bootstrap 抽样次数"

msgctxt "CompareContinuousDistributions|"
msgid "Parametric bootstrap from x samples"
msgstr "从 x 个样本进行参数 Bootstrap"

msgctxt "CompareContinuousDistributions|"
msgid ""
"Obtain the p-value of the goodness-of-fit tests using parametric bootstrap. "
"In this case, the test statistics are always Kolmorogov-Smirnov, and Cramér–"
"von Mises and Anderson-Darling for simple null hypothesis."
msgstr ""
"使用参数 Bootstrap 获得拟合优度检验的 p 值。在这种情况下，检验统计量始终为简"
"单零假设下的 Kolmogorov-Smirnov、Cramér-von Mises 和 Anderson-Darling。"

